{
    "title": "WavePay APP by Wave Money",
    "description": "Fast, Easy and Safe Online payments - Myanmar's Leading Mobile Financial Service\r\nWavePay, Mobile wallet application by WaveMoney enabling the inclusion of all users into the digital payment ecosystem, riding on the largest network of ~60,000 agents and 200,000+ merchants. WavePay is one stop solution for all your payment needs:\r\n\u2022\tSend money to your family and friends using mobile number, including to those who are not on WavePay APP\r\n\u2022\tScan QR code and make instant payments at grocery stores, medical shops, electronic shops, restaurants etc.\r\n\u2022\tTop up or buy packs for your or your family and friends mobile.\r\n\u2022\tPay your bills easily \u2013 Internet, Solar, Insurance, MFI loans etc.\r\n\u2022\tLink your bank or MPU cards and easily transfer funds in and out of the wallet easily.\r\nSafe and Secure payments\r\n\u2022\tProtected with \u201cOne Wallet, One Device\u201d (1W1D) feature that enables access of your account from only 1 device at any point of time, keeping your WavePay account safe & secure. \r\n\u2022\tSet your PIN, which is a 4-digit number, it\u2019s mandatory to set the PIN while creating your account and authorize all transactions using your PIN\r\n\u2022\tAdditional security of 6-digit secret code for money transfer to people who are not on WavePay app. Money can be easily collected at the nearest WaveMoney agent shop by providing transaction ID and 6-digit secret code\r\nEasy Cash-in and Cash-out services\r\n\u2022\tEasily Cash-in or Cash-out at your near Wave agent shops; more than 60,000 agents across the country are at your service all the time\r\n\u2022\tLink your bank accounts from our partner banks or any e-commerce enabled MPU cards for easily moving funds in and out of the wallet\r\nEasy Airtime top up and bill payments.\r\n\u2022\tTop up or buy packs for your mobile and always stay connected with your loved ones. You can top up to any operator mobile number \u2013 ATOM, MPT, Ooredoo\r\n\u2022\tMake your internet bill payments across 30+ providers including ATOM, Ooredoo, Myanmar Net, 5BB, Fortune, Mahar Net, WeLink, Myanmar APN etc.\r\n\u2022\tMake your loan repayments across 40+ partners including \u2013 Aeon, Rent2Own, Early Dawn, Yoma Bank, Mahar Bawga,, Advans, Alliance, VisionFund etc.\r\n\u2022\tMake your Insurance payments of Prudential, Manulife, Capital Taiyo, Young Insurance, KBZ MS General Insurance etc\r\n\u2022\tMake your Solar bill payments of OV Solar, Solar Home, Sun King Solar\r\n\u2022\tMake your healthcare and telehealth service payments of PunHlaing Hospitals, MyanCare, myDoctor, Health4U, T-Fitness etc. \r\nFast and reliable payments at Online stores\r\n\u2022\tMake your online shopping payments at Shop.com.mm, OwayFresh and many other trusted partners instantly using WavePay and avoid worries about cash on delivery. \r\n\u2022\tOrder your favorite food or groceries on FoodPanda and pay using WavePay app\r\nBook Hotels & Tickets for Bus, Flights\r\n\u2022\tDomestic or international; One-way or Round trip \u2013 Book your flight tickets on FlyMya, AirKBZ etc and make payments with your WavePay wallet.\r\n\u2022\tBook online bus tickets - MMBus Ticket, Oway, AungSan, AungMinGalar, Mandalay Gate. Check seat availability & get real-time updates.\r\n\u2022\tBook hotels before you travel \u2013 Memories Hotel, Memories Travel, Balloons Over Myanmar, etc. \r\n\u2022\tMake hassle free payments for your groceries, medicines, electronics, clothing purchases by scanning Wave QR at 200,000+ merchants. \r\n\r\nContact Us\r\n\u2022\tWaveMoney Call Centre is available every day 8AM-10PM to provide any assistance. Call 900 from ATOM Numbers (free) or 097900090000 for other operator numbers\r\nTo become a business partner, agent? E-mail us at business@wavemoney.com.mm or call our call-center",
    "descriptionHTML": "Fast, Easy and Safe Online payments - Myanmar&#39;s Leading Mobile Financial Service<br>WavePay, Mobile wallet application by WaveMoney enabling the inclusion of all users into the digital payment ecosystem, riding on the largest network of ~60,000 agents and 200,000+ merchants. WavePay is one stop solution for all your payment needs:<br>\u2022\tSend money to your family and friends using mobile number, including to those who are not on WavePay APP<br>\u2022\tScan QR code and make instant payments at grocery stores, medical shops, electronic shops, restaurants etc.<br>\u2022\tTop up or buy packs for your or your family and friends mobile.<br>\u2022\tPay your bills easily \u2013 Internet, Solar, Insurance, MFI loans etc.<br>\u2022\tLink your bank or MPU cards and easily transfer funds in and out of the wallet easily.<br>Safe and Secure payments<br>\u2022\tProtected with \u201cOne Wallet, One Device\u201d (1W1D) feature that enables access of your account from only 1 device at any point of time, keeping your WavePay account safe &amp; secure. <br>\u2022\tSet your PIN, which is a 4-digit number, it\u2019s mandatory to set the PIN while creating your account and authorize all transactions using your PIN<br>\u2022\tAdditional security of 6-digit secret code for money transfer to people who are not on WavePay app. Money can be easily collected at the nearest WaveMoney agent shop by providing transaction ID and 6-digit secret code<br>Easy Cash-in and Cash-out services<br>\u2022\tEasily Cash-in or Cash-out at your near Wave agent shops; more than 60,000 agents across the country are at your service all the time<br>\u2022\tLink your bank accounts from our partner banks or any e-commerce enabled MPU cards for easily moving funds in and out of the wallet<br>Easy Airtime top up and bill payments.<br>\u2022\tTop up or buy packs for your mobile and always stay connected with your loved ones. You can top up to any operator mobile number \u2013 ATOM, MPT, Ooredoo<br>\u2022\tMake your internet bill payments across 30+ providers including ATOM, Ooredoo, Myanmar Net, 5BB, Fortune, Mahar Net, WeLink, Myanmar APN etc.<br>\u2022\tMake your loan repayments across 40+ partners including \u2013 Aeon, Rent2Own, Early Dawn, Yoma Bank, Mahar Bawga,, Advans, Alliance, VisionFund etc.<br>\u2022\tMake your Insurance payments of Prudential, Manulife, Capital Taiyo, Young Insurance, KBZ MS General Insurance etc<br>\u2022\tMake your Solar bill payments of OV Solar, Solar Home, Sun King Solar<br>\u2022\tMake your healthcare and telehealth service payments of PunHlaing Hospitals, MyanCare, myDoctor, Health4U, T-Fitness etc. <br>Fast and reliable payments at Online stores<br>\u2022\tMake your online shopping payments at Shop.com.mm, OwayFresh and many other trusted partners instantly using WavePay and avoid worries about cash on delivery. <br>\u2022\tOrder your favorite food or groceries on FoodPanda and pay using WavePay app<br>Book Hotels &amp; Tickets for Bus, Flights<br>\u2022\tDomestic or international; One-way or Round trip \u2013 Book your flight tickets on FlyMya, AirKBZ etc and make payments with your WavePay wallet.<br>\u2022\tBook online bus tickets - MMBus Ticket, Oway, AungSan, AungMinGalar, Mandalay Gate. Check seat availability &amp; get real-time updates.<br>\u2022\tBook hotels before you travel \u2013 Memories Hotel, Memories Travel, Balloons Over Myanmar, etc. <br>\u2022\tMake hassle free payments for your groceries, medicines, electronics, clothing purchases by scanning Wave QR at 200,000+ merchants. <br><br>Contact Us<br>\u2022\tWaveMoney Call Centre is available every day 8AM-10PM to provide any assistance. Call 900 from ATOM Numbers (free) or 097900090000 for other operator numbers<br>To become a business partner, agent? E-mail us at business@wavemoney.com.mm or call our call-center",
